  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 515.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 515.01 Applicability.\n\n(a) Subject to (b), below, the rules in this part shall apply to any person who wishes to:\n\n(1) Construct a boathouse;\n\n(2) Modify, repair, or replace a dug-in basin or boathouse in, over, or in the bank of, non-tidal waters; or\n\n(3) Modify, repair, or replace any structures regulated under RSA 482-A:26.\n\n(b) The rules in this part shall not apply to maintenance and repairs undertaken pursuant to a statutory exemption as clarified in Env-Wt 308.02.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13776, eff 10-13-23; ss by #14389, eff 9-25-25, EXPIRES: 9-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
